# Base system for every Forsteri install.
#
# Specs without a codename use the base order (colony, ice, nest), so these are
# Arch core/extra packages. `base` is Arch's meta-package; it is not a group
# (`@base` would fail, since current Arch has no group with that name).

linux
linux-firmware
amd-ucode
intel-ucode
base

# Forsteri's own boot experience
mkinitcpio
plymouth
grub
efibootmgr

# Day-to-day base
networkmanager
sudo
nano
less
man-db
which
htop
fastfetch
curl
ca-certificates
zstd
xz
gzip
dosfstools
e2fsprogs
btrfs-progs
